# Task 162-025 — Execution Plan

## Goal
READ-ONLY audit of src/cli/commands/init.ts, plan.ts, set-directives.ts, init-templates.ts.
Apply 10 audit dimensions per Sprint 162 Lane 1 mandate. Output single audit
report at docs/audits/sprint-162-live/T-162-LIVE-025-cli-planning.md.

## Lead Questions
- ADR-018 multi-environment config generation correctness
- structured/ai/auto mode wire (planning mode dispatch)
- init lifecycle adapter generation
- DIRECTIVES.md handling (set-directives, init template)

## Approach
1. Read 4 target files in full (init.ts, plan.ts, set-directives.ts, init-templates.ts)
2. Discover related modules referenced by them (init-templates is imported by init.ts)
3. Cross-reference ADR-018 (multi-environment config)
4. Apply 10 dimensions:
   - Dead code (unused exports)
   - ADR violations (44 active ADRs)
   - Conflicting areas (duplicated logic)
   - Drift (comments vs behavior)
   - Type safety (any, ts-ignore)
   - Dependency hygiene (.js extensions, circular)
   - Documentation pollution
   - Memory V2 coherence (where applicable)
   - Config integrity
   - Migration triage (KEEP-PRIVATE / MIGRATE-PUBLIC / DELETE-CANDIDATE / UNCERTAIN)
5. Write findings with file:line evidence
6. Write recommendations (NO code changes)

## Scope Constraint
- WRITE ONLY: docs/audits/sprint-162-live/T-162-LIVE-025-cli-planning.md
- READ ANY: project-wide for context/cross-reference

## Verify
- tsc --noEmit (no source changes — should be no impact)
- vitest run (no source changes — no impact)

## Output
Single Markdown audit report with sections:
1. Scope
2. Findings (severity P0/P1/P2/P3, dimension, summary)
3. Evidence (file:line citations)
4. Migration triage per file
5. Recommendation
